Only one yes post explicitly reports buying something for this feeding problem, so there is one purchase quote rather than five. Using a brand or owning feeding equipment is not counted as payment; “got some nipple shields” does not specify buying them. The husband’s adult dental spending is reported context, not a purchase for the child’s feeding problem.

